### List items
GET http://localhost:8080/api/items

### Add a new character
POST http://localhost:8080/api/items
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Furina", "itemType": "CHARACTER", "rarity": 5, "pool": "LIMITED"}

### Try adding a duplicate (should fail with 409)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/items
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "furina", "itemType": "CHARACTER", "rarity": 5, "pool": "LIMITED"}

### Try deleting a built-in item (should fail with 409)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/items/1

